IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTDECODE-V3.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ACTIVE-WARPS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPEC-DEPTH          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PIPELINE-STAGES     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTDECODE-V3.
    IF SEQ-LEN == 0 OR ACTIVE-WARPS == 0 OR SPEC-DEPTH == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE SPEC-DEPTH TO PIPELINE-STAGES.
    MULTIPLY 2 BY PIPELINE-STAGES.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PIPELINE-STAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 ACTIVE-WARPS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
